# [[.Label]]

A theme for [Kosatka](https://github.com/kosatka-cms/kosatka): the
engine's layout in colours of its own, with an accent colour the site's
administrator chooses.

## Install

From the site's project directory:

```bash
app theme add <this repository's address>
```

Then choose it on the **Appearance** page.

## Develop

| Path | What's there |
|---|---|
| `theme.yaml` | the manifest: name, regions, blocks, settings |
| `static/css/[[.Name]].css` | the stylesheet |
| `templates/` | the engine's templates the theme replaces (same relative path) |
| `translations/` | the theme's strings in other languages |

- [Create a theme](https://kosatka-cms.github.io/kosatka/themes/create-a-theme/),
  [Templates](https://kosatka-cms.github.io/kosatka/themes/templates/).
- Before a release: `app theme check` in the theme's directory, a
  screenshot (`static/screenshot.jpg`), then
  [Distributing a theme](https://kosatka-cms.github.io/kosatka/themes/distribute/).
